  "purpose": "Frozen point-in-time financial-negative-list data collection and evidence-availability protocol for the E10b adjudicator. Defines exact source endpoints, fields, PIT availability semantics, rule math thresholds, scope, and freshness. This protocol does not modify the existing E10b evaluator or deploy rules. Any future threshold/scope change requires a new protocol version and ledger entry.",
  "not_alpha_evidence": true,
